# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Build context for the Dockerfiles at the repository root and under
# deploy/docker/ (RM-076, #109).
#
# The Go build needs the module and its sources and nothing else; the dashboard
# build needs web/ and nothing else. Everything below is either large, secret,
# or a host artifact that must never end up in an image — and a build context
# is uploaded to the daemon whole, so an exclusion here is a real cost saved
# and not tidiness.

.git
.github
.claude
.codemap
.wave-guard
.wrangler

# docs/ is local-only and never published (see .claude/CLAUDE.md); it has no
# business in a build context that produces a distributable image.
docs
runbooks
reviews

# Host build artifacts. `innsegl` is `make build`'s output and would shadow
# nothing, but copying a darwin binary into a linux image context is pure
# waste; cover.out likewise.
innsegl
innsegl-stub
cover.out

# The dashboard's dependencies and its previous build. Both are regenerated
# inside the image from package-lock.json, and node_modules is by far the
# largest directory in the tree.
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report

**/.DS_Store
